# The phone layout (390 × 844 at DPR 3) by touch: New Game, a bid, the first
# lead (South leads, so any card is legal), How to play and its Close.
# viewport 390x844@3
until 600 Press New Game
frames 20
touch =New Game
until 120 Your bid
frames 10
save phone-bid
touch =Bid 1
until 600 Your turn
frames 20
touch 12% 87.5%
until 200 12 cards
frames 20
save phone-play
touch =Help
until 120 How to play
frames 10
save phone-help
touch =Close
frames 20
expect South (You)
